<title>UK: Chiroscience sees 2 mln stg/month cash burn.</title>
<headline>Chiroscience sees 2 mln stg/month cash burn.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiroscience Group Plc said on Monday it expected its cash burn rate in the current year to February 1998 to be &quot;in the arena of&quot; 2 million stg ($3.2 million) a month.</p>
<p>In a telephone interview with Reuters, finance director Christine Soden said the cash burn would be &quot;a little bit higher than last year,&quot; when operating losses totalled 21.0 million stg. ($ = 0.616 British Pounds)</p>
</text>
